{
    "word": "peristyle",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                "word": "peristyle",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "292c8b99-fa3a-4ba7-8cf7-25b198c6b198",
                        "entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "peristyles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b243bfe-a0be-3ad9-ba67-42c88bd2fbd8",
                        "entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A colonnade surrounding a courtyard, temple, etc., or the yard enclosed by such columns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac0c1504-6933-4a55-af51-5bb6bc503438",
                                "sense_id": "8b243bfe-a0be-3ad9-ba67-42c88bd2fbd8",
                                "text": "One cannot, for example, see the Temple of Æsculapius as one stands in the fine open courtyard as it was intended one should do; the interstices on that side of the peristyle have been blocked by Venetian Gothic buildings."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc79736a-8723-3899-899c-b30ec2bf8ae9",
                        "entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A porch surrounded by columns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15ee733b-cfb1-3032-9e58-2a971450e3e6",
                        "entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sacred roofed courtyard with a central pillar (the potomitan), used as a space for voodoo ceremonies, either alone or as an adjunct to an enclosed temple or altar-room."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5561b5b0-b428-4a39-8c7b-596502f52a03",
                                "sense_id": "15ee733b-cfb1-3032-9e58-2a971450e3e6",
                                "text": "The peristyle is a roofed structure, open at the sides, in which most of the ceremonials and dances take place."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfab79e9-7187-4f08-81a9-8681b2a25ceb",
                                "sense_id": "15ee733b-cfb1-3032-9e58-2a971450e3e6",
                                "text": "Most peristyles in Haiti have hard-packed dirt floors that can soak up libations when they're poured on the ground in honor of the spirits."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2616438-cd54-4604-ba7c-b810cad423f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "source_sense_description": "colonnade surrounding a courtyard, temple, etc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "perystyl",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perystyl",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2733ea3d-64f5-3e0c-bce9-a16aa8353262",
                                        "entry_id": "d2dd6981-5aad-34f2-b7c0-592334bdbe2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "dziedziniec lub ogród wewnętrzny otoczony kolumnadą"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de36268d-3c42-4c1e-8816-bc31aa003ff1",
                                                "sense_id": "2733ea3d-64f5-3e0c-bce9-a16aa8353262",
                                                "text": "Dobudówka składała się z perystylu i sali zebrań dla gminy"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d84f0ea-476f-3296-a2e8-294f4b688f47",
                                        "entry_id": "d2dd6981-5aad-34f2-b7c0-592334bdbe2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kolumnada otaczająca dziedziniec lub ogród"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809fa91b-6dc1-40ef-9b75-ec94016a1322",
                                                "sense_id": "8d84f0ea-476f-3296-a2e8-294f4b688f47",
                                                "text": "Bezpośrednio za perystylem znajdowała się długa pergola z wodotryskami i rzeźbami"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e4f7716-ab91-47cd-9c90-687f7115b0cd",
                        "source_entry_id": "28927359-6992-3d7e-9113-007930285f88",
                        "source_sense_description": "a courtyard; the space surrounded by a colonnade",
                        "target_lang_word": "péristyle",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "péristyle",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c42d51b-27e1-3bc2-9635-1fb454df0115",
                                        "entry_id": "d5c44030-1cf1-3794-8cf0-ec4ef88d49f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Colonnade entourant la cour intérieure d’un bâtiment ou disposée autour d’un édifice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e28915a-7140-414e-841f-e6c7c31c7b31",
                                                "sense_id": "7c42d51b-27e1-3bc2-9635-1fb454df0115",
                                                "text": "Les troncs de ces arbres, rouges marbrés de vert, montant sans branches jusqu’à leurs cimes, ressemblaient à de hautes colonnes, et formaient le péristyle de ce temple de la mort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2162b3e8-df44-4b19-b196-63e8d0626fbb",
                                                "sense_id": "7c42d51b-27e1-3bc2-9635-1fb454df0115",
                                                "text": "Deux obélisques de fonte sont posés à chaque bout comme au péristyle d’un monument thébain, et cet ornement n’est pas déplacé là, car le gigantesque génie architectural des Pharaons ne désavouerait pas le pont de Cubzac."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43c6c52c-6d8f-4402-bf64-9f9a921e9258",
                                                "sense_id": "7c42d51b-27e1-3bc2-9635-1fb454df0115",
                                                "text": "Cependant Cinq-Mars, accompagné de MM. du Lude et Fournier et de tous les personnages les plus importants, s’était mis à l’abri de l’orage sous le péristyle de l’église de Sainte-Croix, élevée sur vingt degrés de pierre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "577428b9-b79c-313d-852a-fed4230564ae",
                                        "entry_id": "d5c44030-1cf1-3794-8cf0-ec4ef88d49f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Galerie fermée d’un côté par une colonnade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c1b98a3-4ba1-4513-8ca2-db965a265410",
                                                "sense_id": "577428b9-b79c-313d-852a-fed4230564ae",
                                                "text": "Quand le père et la fille arrivèrent sous le péristyle du pavillon […], et par où les promeneurs vont et viennent du jardin des Tuileries dans le Carrousel, les factionnaires leur crièrent d'une voix grave : - On ne passe plus !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "943c9776-fb13-4bf2-8d7b-24cb1a468ec7",
                                                "sense_id": "577428b9-b79c-313d-852a-fed4230564ae",
                                                "text": "[…], Hervé allait filer tout doucement du côté opposé, lorsqu'il aperçut, appuyé contre un portant, un monsieur qu'il reconnut pour l'avoir croisé plusieurs fois sous le péristyle du théâtre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
